WEBVTT

00:04:29.625 --> 00:04:33.559
that at one time, a guy asked Jesus,
"Who was my neighbor?

00:04:33.583 --> 00:04:35.476
Who was my fellow citizen?

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:37.351
Who am I responsible for?"

00:04:37.375 --> 00:04:40.559
And instead of a short answer,
Jesus replied with a parable.

00:04:40.583 --> 00:04:43.018
He said there was a man on a journey,

00:04:43.042 --> 00:04:45.226
walking down Jericho Road.

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:46.809
As he was walking down the road,

00:04:46.833 --> 00:04:49.309
he was beat up,
left on the side of the road,

00:04:49.333 --> 00:04:50.768
stripped of all his clothes,

00:04:50.792 --> 00:04:53.726
had everything stolen from
and left to die.

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:58.143
And then a priest came by,
saw the man on the side of the road,

00:04:58.167 --> 00:05:00.059
maybe said a silent prayer,